      "quote": "## Workspace roles\n\nEvery workspace member has one of three roles:\n\n* **Member** - Uses Warp within their teams and the policies admins configure.\n* **Admin** - Manages workspace membership, billing, and settings, with admin-level permissions on every team, including teams they don't belong to. Team admins who aren't workspace admins have admin permissions only on their teams.\n* **Owner** - Has every admin capability and can transfer ownership to another member. Each workspace has one owner.\n\nIn team member lists, the **Workspace admin** and **Workspace owner** badges distinguish workspace roles from team roles.\n",
      "source": {
        "canonical_identity": "path:src/content/docs/enterprise/team-management/workspaces.mdx",
        "content_sha256": "6f83e912f7e3eca0d942a8cb6f4cfa09ac5f1494dce1a92a52a26d09969f40dd",
